  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"twentysix plants is literally 26 pages of paper handmade from 26 everyday plants grown or foraged at the Women's Studio Workshop ArtFarm. The book's publication coincides with the 50th anniversary of Ed Ruscha's iconic road book Twentysix Gasoline Stations--a slim and elegant machine-bound paperback. twentysix plants is rough and chunky and handbound and celebrates standing in one place"--Women's Studio Workshop, viewed December 14, 2021.</subfield>
